{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandatory enhanced DBS checks for all wedding industry professionals",
        "additional_details": "Currently, individuals working in the wedding sector\u2014including DJs, photographers, planners, videographers, pet chaperones and venue staff\u2014are not legally required to undergo criminal record checks. Weddings are deeply personal, high-trust events where professionals gain intimate access to families, private properties, changing areas, and vulnerable individuals, including children and the elderly.\r\n\r\nWe think implementing mandatory Enhanced DBS checks within the wedding industry will close a legal loophole.",
        "background": "We call on the government to introduce legislation requiring mandatory Enhanced DBS (Disclosure and Barring Service) checks for all professionals working within the wedding industry who interact directly with couples, families, and guests.",
